#. type: Title ==
#: ../src/production-orders.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delivery Notification"
msgstr "配送通知"

#. type: #notification
#: ../src/production-orders.adoc:60
msgid "When all items in a production order arrive, and are dispatched to the destination address, a notification is shown on the top-right corner of the screen, to the player that has created the production order."
msgstr "当一个生产订单中的所有物品已到达、并已发货至目标地址时，创建此订单的玩家屏幕右上角将会显示通知。"

#. type: Block title
#: ../src/production-orders.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "\"Order shipped\" notification"
msgstr "“订单已配送”通知"

#. type: #notification
#: ../src/production-orders.adoc:65
msgid "A similar notification is shown when a responsible gauge has become <<term-invalid-gauge,invalid>>."
msgstr "当一个负责的仪表<<term-invalid-gauge,失效>>时，也会显示类似的通知。"

#. type: Block title
#: ../src/production-orders.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "\"Gauge became invalid\" notification"
msgstr "“仪表失效”通知"

#. type: Title ==
#: ../src/production-orders.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mod Compatibility"
msgstr "模组兼容性"

#. type: #mod-compat
#: ../src/production-orders.adoc:73
msgid "Other mods may provide UIs alternative to the stock keeper for ordering items, such as handheld remote stock keepers. These UIs are likely able to create production orders without explicit support. However, they will not be able to view pending production orders, and will not display <<notification,delivery notifications>>."
msgstr "其他模组可能会提供替代仓库管理员的订购界面，例如手持的远程仓库管理员。这些界面通常无需特地支持也可创建生产订单，但它们无法查看待处理的生产订单，也不会显示<<notification,配送通知>>。"

#. type: #mod-compat
#: ../src/production-orders.adoc:75
msgid "The following mods are tested to work with production orders, and have explicit support to display notifications:"
msgstr "以下模组经测试可与生产订单配合使用，并被添加了对通知的支持："

#. type: #mod-compat
#: ../src/production-orders.adoc:77
msgid "Create: Mobile Packages"
msgstr "机械动力：无人机物流（Mobile Packages）"

#. type: #mod-compat
#: ../src/production-orders.adoc:77
msgid "Create: Phantom"
msgstr "机械动力：幻翼物流（Phantom）"
